{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":54757,"duration_api_ms":54155,"num_turns":16,"result":"I rewrote the existing `CLAUDE.md`. I didn't build or run anything, and the \"libbpf is also expected there\" line comes from a Makefile path, since `src/third_party/libbpf` is empty here. The old version had several gaps:\n\n- **Submodules:** it never said that `src/third_party/` is empty until you run `git submodule update --init --recursive`.\n- **Two build styles:** examples 1–10 have no Makefile and use eunomia-bpf (`ecc` and `ecli`). Examples 11 and up mostly use libbpf with a Makefile.\n- **Master Makefile:** the master Makefile is at `src/Makefile`, not in the repo root.\n- **Tests:** there is no test suite or lint config. CI builds the examples and runs them under `timeout`, treating exit code 124 as a pass.\n- **Build pipeline:** the file now covers the pipeline from `.bpf.c` to skeleton to userspace binary, the `../third_party` layout, and the `vmlinux.h` CO-RE headers.\n- **Docs tooling:** I added a section on the scripts in `src/scripts/` and the bilingual README convention.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8d304985-c9f4-42aa-a373-05363c2de730","total_cost_usd":0.24067349999999996,"usage":{"input_tokens":22,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13084,"cache_read_input_tokens":311775,"output_tokens":6534,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13084},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":387,"cache_read_input_tokens":36816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2063,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2063,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":22,"outputTokens":6534,"cacheReadInputTokens":311775,"cacheCreationInputTokens":13084,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.24067349999999